&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hackclub.com/fiscal-sponsorship/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;HCB&lt;/a&gt; codebase!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-hcb&#34;&gt;What is HCB?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;HCB is an &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hackclub.com/fiscal-sponsorship/open-source/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;open source&lt;/a&gt;,
safe, and easy-to-use fiscal sponsorship platform for hackathons, Hack Clubs,
robotic teams and more. We use it to run
our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hackclub.com/fiscal-sponsorship/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;fiscal sponsorship program&lt;/a&gt;, we
provide high schoolers with a 501(c)(3) status-backed restricted fund for their
organization. Behind the scenes, HCB is a Ruby on Rails application (learn more
by reading &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/dev-docs&#34; &gt;our documentation&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;1377&#34; alt=&#34;Screenshot of Hack Club HQ&#39;s finances on HCB&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/hackclub/hcb/assets/39828164/b19a83b2-ba81-46b0-9f6f-2772f4249071&#34;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;table-of-contents&#34;&gt;Table of Contents
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#what-is-hcb&#34; &gt;What is HCB?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#table-of-contents&#34; &gt;Table of Contents&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#i-found-a-security-vulnerability-what-should-i-do&#34; &gt;Security&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#quick-start&#34; &gt;Quick start&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#contributing&#34; &gt;Contributing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/hackclub/hcb/blob/main/dev-docs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;i-found-a-security-vulnerability-what-should-i-do&#34;&gt;I found a security vulnerability! What should I do?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please email &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;mailto:hcb-security@hackclub.com&#34; &gt;hcb-security@hackclub.com&lt;/a&gt; to
report the vulnerability. We currently don&amp;rsquo;t have a bug bounty program but, as a
token of appreciation, we&amp;rsquo;d love to mail you a t-shirt and give you a shoutout
on our GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;quick-start&#34;&gt;Quick start
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;To run HCB in a development environment, follow the setup instructions in
our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/dev-docs/development.md&#34; &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt;. We support development through
Codespaces, Docker, and a native setup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are so excited for you to join the codebase! We have a getting started
documentation in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/dev-docs/development.md&#34; &gt;&lt;code&gt;dev-docs&lt;/code&gt; folder&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All contributors are expected to follow the Hack
Club &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hackclub.com/conduct&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Code of Conduct&lt;/a&gt; and Hack
Club&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/hackclub/hackclub/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;contributing guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hackclub.slack.com/archives/C068U0JMV19&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;#hcb-dev&lt;/a&gt; channel on the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hackclub.com/slack&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Hack Club Slack&lt;/a&gt; for support.&lt;/p&gt;
